%% plan.mmd — Mermaid views for the 2026-08-24 CPU optimisation plan
%% Render: mmdc -i plan.mmd -o plan.svg   (mermaid-cli absent on this host;
%% GitHub and most editors render these blocks inline).

%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
%% View 1 — Sequence: measure -> optimise -> re-measure, per target area
%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Engineer
    participant Bench as Criterion harness
    participant Core as hymeko_core::TensorCsr
    participant Hnn as hymeko_hnn kernels
    participant Test as cargo test --release
    participant Prof as samply

    Note over Dev,Bench: Phase 0 — harness before any edit
    Dev->>Bench: author deterministic workloads (small/medium/large)
    Bench-->>Dev: --save-baseline before

    Note over Dev,Prof: Phase 1 — find the real bottleneck (no guessing)
    Dev->>Prof: profile HGNN forward + from_ir
    Prof-->>Dev: hot-symbol attribution

    Note over Dev,Hnn: Phase 2 — optimise the largest PROVEN cost first
    Dev->>Core: spmv_into / spmm_into (+ serial | parallel)
    Dev->>Hnn: node-first scatter, feature-blocked conv
    Hnn-->>Dev: allocations removed from hot loops

    Note over Dev,Test: Phase 3 — correctness gate
    Dev->>Test: serial vs parallel (bitwise), vs reference, degenerate shapes
    Test-->>Dev: 17 unit + 106 integration, 57/58 drift reported separately

    Note over Dev,Bench: Phase 4 — re-measure the AFFECTED cells only
    Dev->>Bench: --baseline before
    Bench-->>Dev: median + CI delta per cell
    alt regression > 10%
        Dev->>Prof: profile, attribute, fix — default assumption is "a bug"
    else improvement > 10%
        Dev->>Prof: confirm cost left the targeted site
    end
